Exception — OpenSysML Libraries/
--------------------------------

The `OpenSysML Libraries/` subdirectory is NOT from OMG. Its files are non-normative
OpenSysML extensions, authored by the OpenSysML project and licensed under Apache 2.0
like the rest of OpenSysML. They are bundled here so they load alongside the standard
library, and no OMG copyright or EPL-2.0 term applies to them.
